      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I feel good with you.' Relaxing together, Max tells Sasha how good it feels to be with her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Мне тоже хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I feel good too.' Sasha smiles and says she feels great with him too.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Особенно когда ты без одежды.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Especially when you are without clothes.' She teases him playfully that she likes him even better without his work uniform.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ты очень смешная.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are very funny.' Max laughs and calls her very funny.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Я серьезно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am serious.' Sasha grins and says she means it seriously. Then Max replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know.' Max replies smoothly that he knows.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Тебе вызвать такси?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Should I call you a taxi?' Glancing at the clock, Sasha asks if she should call him a cab.",
